			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1481,
				2
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Enforce explicit function qualification in environment providers\n\nUpdate `CommandProvider.rs` and `StorageProvider.rs` to replace direct struct method calls with the explicit `::Fn()` qualification pattern for `DebugOnce` and `IsShort` helpers within the `IPC::DevLog` module. This change aligns the `MountainEnvironment` implementation with the project's recent modularization efforts, resolving potential symbol shadowing and ensuring strict adherence to the PascalCase naming and explicit namespace resolution conventions.\n\nThis adjustment ensures that logging probes for command execution and storage updates are invoked consistently with the rest of the boot and command handler architecture.",
			"SHA": "1d9fb10b0b21f85fef0ad3ba090f2111bc26b9b0"
